    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What these three visuals say",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11.0pt",
                      "color": "#2C5F8D",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "▪  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#2C5F8D",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Cost per click by day: a step change on 17 January — CPC averaged $0.46 across 1–16 January and $0.16 for the remainder of the month.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#16232E"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "▪  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#2C5F8D",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Weekly spend pacing: the budget was front-loaded. $32,804 (69%) went out in the first 16 days at $4.95 per application, and a single day — 31 January — absorbed $4,832 (10.2%) at $6.88.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#16232E"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "▪  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#2C5F8D",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Weekly scorecard: the cheapest week (week of 21 January, $1.76 per application) received the smallest share of budget at 11%, while the two most expensive weeks took 55% between them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#16232E"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#16232E"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Why this matters to Metro Staffing:  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#C0483F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "pacing was driven by the calendar rather than by price. Holding budget back for low-CPC windows and capping any single day's share would have bought materially more applications from the identical $47,543 — no new money, only better timing.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#16232E"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
